# Only the web app and its content go into the image; the newsroom stays on dev-host.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.env*
**/.DS_Store
.preview
.claude
pipeline
docs
guides
# The build reads config/pipelines (the article types and their diagrams) and config/topics.yaml; the rest stays out
config/*
!config/pipelines
!config/topics.yaml
contracts
evals
runs
readings
cache
packages/tokens/tokens.css
apps/web/generated
apps/web/public/data
apps/web/public/pdf
